# No model, endpoint or key required for the offline profile.
# Hosted profiles are described in profiles/*.env.example. Treat those files
# as checklists only; set credentials in this git-ignored file or trusted shell.
# Set routing, endpoint, deployment, model and executable values in a trusted shell.
# Optional startup-check switches can also be set in the trusted shell:
# TOKN_NO_REGISTER=1
# TOKN_NO_UPDATE_CHECK=1
